The simplest, most effective AI video generation workflow in ComfyUI — running WAN 2.2 Image to Video (I2V). Drop in an image, write a prompt, get a video. No bloat, no overcomplicated node setups. Just results.
In this video I walk you through every part of the workflow: the models, the LoRAs, how to set your resolution, and how to control your video length. If you're new to ComfyUI video generation, this is the perfect starting point.

