🔍 ABOUT THIS WORKFLOW
This workflow uses WAN 2.2 Image to Video — a dual-model pipeline (high noise + low noise) running 14B parameter models in FP8/FP16 precision. The Seko 4-step distill LoRAs allow the full pipeline to run in just 4 sampling steps, making it fast without sacrificing output quality. Resolution and video length are fully adjustable directly inside the WanImageToVideo node.
Built and tested by LoRAtech. Free to use and share.

